# Play uses the shared game_core. City rules are not wired yet.
GAME   | name        | chicago-loop
GAME   | title       | Chicago Loop
GAME   | kind        | editor
GAME   | ruleset     | default
GAME   | driver      | {house}/&.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/+x/game_core.+x driver {house} {book} {editor}
GAME   | clock       | pause
GAME   | export      | {house}/&.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/+x/game_core.+x {book} {state} export {out}
